WARZAG_HIDE_WINDOWS=1 keeps a process's windows off the screen.

show_window() never orders a window onto the screen, so the process never becomes a foreground app or gets a Dock
icon; its windows still exist and the program keeps working. Warzag sets it for Digital Extremes' launcher when it
only updates the game.

License: LGPL-2.1-or-later (a change to Wine).

